# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Why this file exists: Cloudflare's automatic clean-URL rewrite already sends
# /home.html to /home, but it does so with a 307 (Temporary). Search engines
# read a 307 as "the original may come back", so they keep the old URL in the
# index and do not consolidate link signals onto the destination. A 301 tells
# them the move is permanent and folds the old URL's authority into the new one.
#
# The marketing page moved from /home to / (it is now index.html), and the
# scroll-driven intro animation moved from / to /intro (intro.html). Every URL
# that was ever public before that swap is redirected here, so existing
# bookmarks, inbound links, and anything already indexed keep working.
#
# First match wins, so these are ordered most-specific first.

# --- the landing page's old homes -> the root -------------------------------
/home.html    /       301
/home         /       301
/index.html   /       301

# --- the intro animation's old home -> its own URL --------------------------
# Nothing linked here by this path, but the intro WAS served at / for a while,
# so anyone who bookmarked the animation itself lands on the marketing page
# above; this rule only cleans up the .html form of its new URL.
/intro.html   /intro  301
